{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2022-01-04 17:08:00', 'title': 'SIMON PROPERTY GROUP SELLS $1.2 BILLION OF SENIOR NOTES', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, JAN. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SIMON, A GLOBAL LEADER IN THE OWNERSHIP OF PREMIER SHOPPING, DINING, ENTERTAINMENT AND MIXED-USE DESTINATIONS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS MAJORITY-OWNED OPERATING PARTNERSHIP SUBSIDIARY, SIMON PROPERTY GROUP, L.P. (THE "OPERATING PARTNERSHIP"), HAS AGREED TO SELL: $500 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS FLOATING RATE NOTES DUE 2024, AND \xa0 $700 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 2.650% NOTES DUE 2032.'}